  "instructions_to_main_agent": "Build CareerPeek as a responsive React single-page app (or multi-view app with clean client-side routing) with landing page, searchable careers directory (/careers), career detail pages (/career/:slug), and interactive roadmap pages with expandable milestones. Ensure robust test data-testid attributes, cheerful Duolingo-inspired friendly UI, LinkedIn search links opening in new tabs, and exact slugs: nurse, software-developer, doctor, chartered-accountant, entrepreneur."
